/var/home/dylan/projects/disclaude/docs/codex-testing-suite-design-6-21-26.md:601:- "Disco" is a local-first agentic LLM application. Backend: a Python uv monorepo of 5 packages (core ← retrieval ← tools ← {agent_server, app_server}). Frontend: React + TypeScript + Vite. It runs an LLM agent loop that, given a user request + a toolbox (file ops, shell, browser, slides_generate, image_gen, deep-research, etc.), takes non-deterministic actions; the same request produces different action sequences across runs. Surfaces: Build, Agent, Deep Research, plus deliverables (slide decks, PDFs, PPTX, audio, sheets).
