            "Markdown path (backward-compat): supply ``markdown`` with '---' slide "
            "separators; rendered via Marp CLI (image-based PPTX) or the HTML "
            "fallback.\n\n"
            "HTML always works.  PDF and native PPTX require the sandbox toolchain."
